{"product":{"id":6236338585788,"title":"Cortech Kangaroo Cart","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe Kangaroo Cart is a rotationally molded plastic delivery cart that provides unmatched durability and versatility. The Cart has a 1000 lb. load rating\/15 bushel capacity. The Cart has both push and pull handles on both ends, and has a drain plug for easy cleaning. There are also  The Cart is perfect for laundry, garbage collection, material handling, or use as a janitor cart. The Kangaroo Cart is manufactured for use in any intense use or high abuse application.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIndoor or outdoor use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUses: laundry collection and delivery, garbage collection, material handling, recycling bin,  general delivery cart, material handling cart, food processing, beverage service container (manufactured with insulated material), janitor cart\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeavy Duty - .200 Nominal Wall Thickness\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1,000 lbs. Load Rating\/15 Bushel Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeavy Duty Casters Secured with Stainless Steel, \u003cspan\u003eTamper-Proof Hardware\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePush Pull Handles On Both Sides\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHandles Accommodate Utility Use - Hanging Trigger Spray Bottle Holders \/ \u003cspan\u003eStorage of Can Liners, Cleaning Instruments, etc.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrain Plug for Easy Cleaning\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHandles and Bottom can be Field-Drilled for Additional Drain Holes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufactured Three Ways: Flame Retardant (Passes Cal 133), \u003cspan\u003eGeneral Use, and Recycled Material. Call for FR test results\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpan Design on Sides And Bottom for Increased Rigidity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo Wood or Metal Components\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 variations:\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlame retardant (passes Cal 133)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGeneral Use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRecycled material\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColors: Green, Blue, Grey, White or Economic Repro Black. \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCart part numbers: \u003cspan\u003eCC200 Gray Flame Retardant, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC783 Green Flame Retardant, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC680 Blue Flame Retardant, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC280 Gray General Use, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC720 Green General Use, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC620 Blue General Use, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC2 White General Use, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC116 Repro Black Recycled\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLid part numbers: \u003cspan\u003eCC200L Gray Flame Retardant, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC783L Green Flame Retardant, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC680L Blue Flame Retardant, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC280L Gray General Use, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC720L Green General Use, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC620L Blue General Use, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC2L White General Use, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCC116L Repro Black Recycled (lid sold separately)\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10 Year Warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Cortech USA by Correctional Technologies:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCortech USA (Correctional Technologies) manufactures products that are exceptionally durable, designed for use in compassionate and normative behavioral healthcare, corrections, law enforcement, heavy use commercial and industrial environments, parks and recreation, schools, universities, hospitals, emergency and homeless shelters, and other institutions and facilities where safety and durability matter. Cortech products are ideal for extreme use and intensive use environments.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Cortech","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-01-29T14:25:11-05:00","handle":"cortech-kangaroo-cart","updated_at":"2026-11-13T17:30:14-05:00","published_at":"2021-01-29T14:25:11-05:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"web","tags":"cortech-kitchen-food-service, cortech-usa, janitorial-prison-carts, kitchen-food-service, Laundry Carts and Hampers, prison-janitorial","variants":[{"id":37961695035580,"product_id":6236338585788,"title":"CC116 - Black Repro Material","price":"700.80","sku":"C601525-01","position":1,"compare_at_price":"876.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"CC116 - Black Repro Material","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2021-01-29T14:25:12-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-13T17:30:14-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"-","grams":115666,"image_id":null,"weight":255.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":37961695068348,"product_id":6236338585788,"title":"CC2 - White Food Grade Material","price":"718.40","sku":"C601525-02","position":2,"compare_at_price":"898.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"CC2 - White Food Grade Material","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2021-01-29T14:25:12-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-13T17:30:14-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"-","grams":115666,"image_id":null,"weight":255.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":37961695101116,"product_id":6236338585788,"title":"CC720 - Green Food Grade Material","price":"718.40","sku":"C601525-03","position":3,"compare_at_price":"898.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management